# Cloudflare Wrangler Local Development Secrets
# Copy this file to .dev.vars for local testing with `wrangler dev`
# DO NOT COMMIT .dev.vars TO GIT (it is in .gitignore)
#
# In production, set this secret in the Cloudflare Dashboard:
# Workers & Pages -> focus-timer -> Settings -> Variables and Secrets -> Add Secret -> AUTH_SECRET
# Or run: npx wrangler secret put AUTH_SECRET
AUTH_SECRET=local-dev-jwt-secret-do-not-use-in-production
